  "instruction": "Prefixes Div By5",
  "output": "    public List<Boolean> prefixesDivBy5(int[] nums) {\n        List<Boolean> ans=new ArrayList<>();\n        int msb=0;\n        for(int x: nums){\n            msb=((msb<<1)+x)%5;\n            ans.add(msb==0);\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }",
